window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>**Blood and Flame: A Dark Fantasy Romance**</p> <p>In a world steeped in shadow and ruled by an unforgiving Queen, Elara hides a deadly secret: she wields forbidden fire magic. Haunted by her past and pursued by those who would see her destroyed, she lives in the shadows of Kaelithar, a kingdom on the brink of rebellion. When fate entwines her path with Valen, the feared and enigmatic Commander of the Queen’s Guard, their connection sparks a dangerous flame neither can ignore. </p> <p>As war brews and dark forces rise, Elara and Valen are thrust into a conflict that threatens not only their lives but the fate of the entire kingdom. Bound by love and divided by loyalty, they must confront their inner demons, navigate treacherous political intrigue, and face the ancient powers that control Kaelithar. But as Elara's magic grows stronger, so does the risk of it consuming her, and Valen's blood oath to the Queen may be the very thing that tears them apart. In this tale of passion, power, and sacrifice, love burns bright amidst the shadows—but will it be enough to save them from the flames of destruction? </p> <p>Perfect for fans of dark fantasy, forbidden romance, and epic battles of magic and will, *Blood and Flame* explores the fine line between love and betrayal in a world where nothing is what it seems. This is the first book for this series.</p>"; 
